            <h2>History</h2>
            <p>
                RapidRush Rafting was founded in 2005 by a group of river enthusiasts who
                shared one dream: to share the thrill of white water with the world. Starting
                with a single raft and a fierce love for the river, we have grown into one of
                the region's most trusted rafting outfitters. Over the years we have guided
                thousands of guests down breathtaking stretches of river, earned numerous
                safety certifications, and built a team of passionate, highly trained guides
                who treat every guest like family.
            </p>
